      "content": "Hey, I'm working on updating our customer service training modules for our new AI support tools. We want to make sure the bot doesn't sound too robotic and can actually build rapport with different types of customers. Can you help me draft two different response templates for a typical shipping delay notification? \n\nFirst, I just need a \"Standard Professional\" version that we can use for our general customer base. Something polished and formal.*",
